'''Large White Ball''' (大玉 (白) ''Ōdama (Shiro)'', '''Large Ball (White)''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Large White Ball
|image = E 576.png
|appearance = [[River City Stages#River City Ball-Rolling|River City Ball-Rolling]]<br>
[[New Year's Bling]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 6|Infernal Tower - Floor 6]]
|money drop = 50¢ - 197¢
}}

==Enemy==
By itself this enemy is quite weak, but when it starts appearing in huge groups, it's not as easy. Its Freeze can be very annoying, though it won't hit much besides the meatshields.

==Strategy==
The best way to deal with huge groups of these enemies is by using [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] with over 200 range, such as [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Figure Skating Cats]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]].

==Variants==
{{Variant
