|Large Red Ball
|A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant that has a 100% chance to knockback along with slightly higher base stats and speed.
|Large Iron Ball
|A [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant that has a 100% chance to slow Cat Units. It has much lower HP, but has higher attack and lower speed compared to its Traitless cousin.
}}

